'''Wrath of the Dogelord (Merciless)''' is the second stage in [[King Wahwah's Return]]. When clearing this stage, the player is guaranteed to unlock the [[True Form]] of [[Glass Cat (Rare Cat)|Glass Cat]], Macho Crystal Cat. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

