==Trivia==
*Wrath of the Dogelord's Japanese name, King of [[Doge|Wanko]] (キングオブワンコ ''Kingu obu Wanko'', "King of Doggies"), may be a reference to the annual stand-up comedy tournament [[wikipedia:ja:キングオブコント|King of Conte]] (キングオブコント ''Kingu obu Konto''). While there are many other "King ofs" that it could also be referring to, ''King of Conte'' is the most likely possibility because [[King Wahwah]]'s Japanese description mentions that he is part of a stand-up comedy duo with [[Mistress Celeboodle]].

